@startuml
' Figure 38.4  Enforcement at the model gateway
' Reading order: top to bottom. The loop asks for a model call; the
' gateway reserves the attempt's worst case in one atomic step against
' the loop day and the envelope; only then is the call sent. Usage
' settles the reservation; a call with no usage settles at the worst
' case, never at zero. From economics.policy.
!include plantuml-theme.puml
participant "Loop" as L <<model>>
participant "Model gateway" as G <<policy>>
participant "Ledger" as B <<evidence>>
participant "Provider" as P <<ops>>
L -> G : Call, max_tokens
G -> B : Reserve worst
B -> G : Fits
G -> P : Send
P -> G : Usage or timeout
G -> B : Settle actual
note over G, B $F_POLICY : No usage: worst
G -[$POLICY]> L : Refused at limit
@enduml
